================================================================================\par
\par
H\u246?rm\u601?tli \u304?stifad\u601?\u231?i,\par
BrowsMe T\u601?hsil Brauzerini ("Proqram T\u601?minat\u305?") qura\u351?d\u305?rmazdan v\u601? istifad\u601? etm\u601?zd\u601?n\par
\u601?vv\u601?l bu \u304?stifad\u601?\u231?i M\u252?qavil\u601?sini diqq\u601?tl\u601? oxuma\u287?\u305?n\u305?z xahi\u351? olunur. Bu proqram\u305?\par
komp\u252?teriniz\u601? qura\u351?d\u305?rmaqla siz a\u351?a\u287?\u305?dak\u305? \u351?\u601?rtl\u601?ri q\u601?bul etmi\u351? olursunuz.\par
\par
1. T\u399?Y\u304?NAT V\u399? T\u399?HL\u220?K\u399?S\u304?ZL\u304?K PR\u304?NS\u304?PL\u399?R\u304?\par
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\par
1.1. BrowsMe - m\u601?kt\u601?blil\u601?r, yeniyetm\u601?l\u601?r (12-17 ya\u351?) v\u601? t\u601?hsil m\u252?\u601?ssis\u601?l\u601?ri \u252?\u231?\u252?n\par
     x\u252?susi olaraq haz\u305?rlanm\u305?\u351? t\u601?hl\u252?k\u601?siz t\u601?hsil v\u601? proqramla\u351?d\u305?rma brauzeridir.\par
1.2. T\u601?tbiq z\u601?r\u601?rli, ya\u351?a uy\u287?un olmayan (b\u246?y\u252?kl\u601?r \u252?\u231?\u252?n m\u601?zmun, qumar v\u601? s.) v\u601?\par
     t\u601?hsil prosesin\u601? mane olan veb-saytlar\u305? avtomatik filtrl\u601?yir v\u601? bloklay\u305?r.\par
1.3. R\u601?smi t\u601?hsil resurslar\u305? (m\u601?s\u601?l\u601?n: edu.az, tedris.edu.az, wikipedia.org)\par
     qorunan a\u287? siyah\u305?dad\u305?r v\u601? mane\u601?siz daxilolma t\u601?min edilir.\par
\par
\b\fs24 2. BROWSME CODE STUDIO V\u399? PROQRAMLA\u350?DIRMA M\u220?H\u304?T\u304?\b0\fs20\par
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\par
